## Chief Executive Officer

**Name:** Dr. Victoria Chen
**Title:** Chief Executive Officer (CEO)
**Reports To:** Board of Directors
**Start Date:** March 2018

### Key Responsibilities
- Corporate strategy development and execution
- Board of Directors relations and reporting
- Mergers and acquisitions oversight
- Investor relations and stakeholder management
- Executive team leadership and development

### Background
Dr. Chen holds a Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering from MIT and an MBA from Harvard Business School. Prior to joining Nexus Industries, she served as COO at Meridian Technologies for 8 years.

